Subject: [PATCH 2485/3799] soh: rename func_80A05114 -> EnElf_TalkSariaText

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: waits out Saria's message and offers to repeat it
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Elf/z_en_elf.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Elf/z_en_elf.c | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Elf/z_en_elf.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Elf/z_en_elf.c
index 3d0047a02..803876c61 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Elf/z_en_elf.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Elf/z_en_elf.c
@@ -22,7 +22,8 @@ void func_80A053F0(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
 void func_80A052F4(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
 void func_80A05208(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
 void func_80A05188(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
-void func_80A05114(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A05114: waits out Saria's message and offers to repeat it
+void EnElf_TalkSariaText(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);  // was func_80A05114 [LLM:HIGH]
